    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Title :</b> When a product is Purchased with a  change the buying price , the system doesn’t calculate the stock valuation correctly. When Creating a Successfully Purchase invoice with a change the buying price , the stock valuation should be updated.</p>

<p><b>Step To Reproduce :</b> <br/>
1. Go to Purchase Invoice .<br/>
2.Select the product.<br/>
3.Enter The Quantity and Change the Buying Price.<br/>
4.Create the Purchase Invoice.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result :</b> When change the Purchase Price the Stock Valuation should be updated Correctly.<br/>
<b>Actual Result :</b> After purchasing the product with a dynamically entered purchase price, the system calculates the <b>stock valuation incorrectly</b>.<br/>
<b>Attachment:</b></p>

<p><a href="https://www.loom.com/share/4de4a4bd527f40c295615c9c0821233a" title="smart-embed" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.loom.com/share/4de4a4bd527f40c295615c9c0821233a</a></p>
            <br/>
